---
import { ArrowRight, CalendarDays } from "@lucide/astro";
---

<section id="calendario" class="school-calendar relative scroll-mt-24 overflow-hidden px-5 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-24 lg:px-8">
	<div class="relative mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_.8fr] lg:gap-20">
		<div class="school-calendar__intro">
			<p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[.24em] text-emerald-700 uppercase">Calendario escolar · 2026–2027</p>
			<h2 class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-.05em] text-slate-950 sm:text-6xl">Un año para aprender y compartir.</h2>
			<p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">Consulta las actividades, fechas importantes, asuetos y efemérides del año escolar en un solo lugar.</p>
			<a href="/calendario/" class="group mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-blue-700 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-white shadow-lg shadow-blue-900/15 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-slate-900">Explorar calendario <ArrowRight size={18} class="transition group-hover:translate-x-1" /></a>
		</div>
		<div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-blue-100 bg-white p-8 shadow-2xl shadow-blue-900/10 sm:p-10">
			<span class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 via-emerald-400 to-blue-400"></span>
			<CalendarDays size={42} strokeWidth={1.5} class="text-blue-700" />
			<p class="mt-10 text-sm font-semibold tracking-[.2em] text-emerald-700 uppercase">Septiembre 2026 — Agosto 2027</p>
			<p class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-950">Cada fecha cuenta.</p>
			<p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-600">Un recorrido mes a mes por la vida escolar, basado en el calendario ministerial y la planificación suministrada.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.school-calendar { background: #213247 url('/calendario-fondo.webp') center 50% / cover no-repeat; }
	.school-calendar::before { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(100deg, rgb(8 24 45 / 81%) 0%, rgb(8 24 45 / 67%) 48%, rgb(8 24 45 / 42%) 100%); pointer-events: none; }
	.school-calendar__intro > p:first-child { color: #86efac; }
	.school-calendar__intro h2 { color: #fff; text-shadow: 0 2px 16px rgb(0 0 0 / 25%); }
	.school-calendar__intro > p:nth-child(3) { color: #f1f5f9; }
</style>
